  ('embedded-ai/py1-code-argv', 'embedded-ai', 'embedded-ai/python-1', 214, 'code', 2, false, '`sys.argv` is the list of words typed on the command line, starting with the script''s own name. If the file `hi.py` holds the code below, what does `python hi.py a b` print?

