  ('embedded-ai/py1-code-exit', 'embedded-ai', 'embedded-ai/python-1', 215, 'code', 2, false, '`sys.exit(message)` stops the program and shows the message as an error. If `greet.py` holds the code below, what happens when you run `python greet.py Ada Bo`?

